annel": "Vaccine Safety Research Foundation", "channel_url": "https://rumble.com/c/VaccineSafetyResearchFoundation", "duration": 5765, "uploader": "Vaccine Safety Research Foundation", "live_status": "was_live", "webpage_url": "https://rumble.com/v6u93iz-episode-180-blowing-the-lid-off-sids.html", "webpage_url_basename": "v6u93iz-episode-180-blowing-the-lid-off-sids.html", "webpage_url_domain": "rumble.com", "extractor": "RumbleEmbed", "extractor_key": "RumbleEmbed", "release_timestamp": 1749164463, "view_count": 17242, "like_count": 269, "dislike_count": 1, "description": "This week, we are honored to welcome back our good friend and straight shooting truth-teller, Dr. Pierre Kory for a powerful and emotional discussion about one of the most heartbreaking and grossly under examined tragedies of our time: Sudden Infant Death Syndrome (SIDS).Show more VSRF, in collaboration with Children’s Health Defense (CHD), has been investigating a disturbing rise in recent SIDS cases—and this Thursday, we’re blowing the lid off the SIDS rabbit hole.\n• What’s really behind these sudden, unexplained infant deaths?\n• What are the risk factors no one is talking about?\n• What do parents deserve to know?\nAnd—critically—what do law enforcement and first responders need to understand when investigating these deaths? Too often, these cases are dismissed without a full medical investigation. We’ll explore the protocols, red flags, and critical questions that must be asked when infant deaths are labeled “unexplained.”\nThis is a can’t-miss episode for parents, advocates, and anyone demanding truth and accountability.\nTune in Thursday at 7 PM ET / 4 PM PT on VSRF LIVE for this timely and important conversation—and as always, bring your best questions!\nSee you there!\nDonations are tax deductible and we need your support to continue our work into 2024. Or to text-to-donate, text VSRF to 53555 Show less", "thumbnail": "https://1a-1791.com/video/fww1/a9/s8/1/B/a/Z/P/BaZPy.qR4e-small-Epis